{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港海關於昨日（22日）在沙頭角中英街採取特別執法行動，檢獲約72萬支懷疑私煙及約2,700件懷疑冒牌物品，估計市值共約460萬元，懷疑私煙的應課稅值約為240萬元，行動中拘捕一名女子。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:23:45.300585+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:43:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:21.061486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:01.776963+00:00","content_hash":"5b9038b10c02382338cff2f43c8e0455483ef953747d20f2e9e2c3f4c1905b35","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}